            "title": "Cooling Gel Memory Foam",
            "text": "<p>The mattress features layers of CertiPUR-US® certified foam and cooling gel memory foam, providing multi-layered support, cloud-like comfort, and enhanced breathability - ideal for small to medium dogs.</p>",
