            "text": "<p>Our Boucle cover is made from heavyweight 600gsm upholstery fabric. With a textured, creamy tone and plush, cosy feel, it delivers comfort and style. OEKO-TEX Standard 100 certified - it’s free from any harmful substances.</p>",
