    "section_image_with_text_PR7fyw": {
      "type": "section-image-with-text",
      "settings": {
        "section_height": "six-fifty-height",
        "layout": "inline",
        "image_location": "left",
        "image_width": "standard",
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/KOOZI-STUDIO-154.jpg",
        "subheading": "",
        "title": "<p>Why You'll Love our Buttercream Boucle Fabric Cover</p>",
        "heading_highlight_type": "circle",
        "highlight_color": "#d43747",
        "highlight_text_color": "#000000",
        "heading_size": 100,
        "content": "<p><strong><br/>Elevated and Timeless Style</strong></p><p>Our Flat Bed in Buttercream Boucle fabric offers seamless integration into any home. With its neutral creamy tone and plush, luxurious texture, its the ultimate cosy retreat for your dog.<br/><br/></p><p><strong>Thick and Durable Fabric</strong></p><p>Crafted with heavy 600 GSM upholstery-grade boucle the same quality used for human sofas - it ensures unmatched quality and style for your home, and your dog's ultimate comfort. Plus its machine washable.<br/><br/></p><p><strong>Cosy and Snug Texture</strong></p><p>The boucle texture offers a snug, cosy feel that’s perfect for any time of year, especially during cooler evenings. Its inviting design encourages your dog to curl up and relax while adding a stylish touch to your living room or bedside interiors.</p>",
        "text_alignment": "left",
        "button_text": "",
        "button_link": "",
        "button_color": "btn--black",
        "button_style": "btn--solid",
        "button_size": "btn--small",
        "video_link": "",
        "text_color": "text-dark",
        "bg_color": "",
        "gradient": "",
        "section_width": "wrapper--full",
        "padding_top": 0,
