    },
    "tabs": {
      "type": "section-accordions",
      "blocks": {
        "acordion-0": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How do I care for the Flat Dog Bed?",
            "text": "<p>Caring for your bed is simple!</p><ol><li><strong>Boucle Cover:</strong> The zip-off cover can be easily removed and machine washed on a cold, gentle cycle with mild detergent. For best results, lay flat to dry.</li><li><strong>Waterproof Liner:</strong> Wipe down the waterproof liner with a spray or soapy water for easy cleaning.</li><li><strong>Foam Core:</strong> If you need to clean the foam, wipe it down with warm, soapy water. Allow it to dry completely in a dry place to ensure all moisture is removed before reassembling the bed.<br/></li></ol><p>By following these care instructions, you can keep your bed looking and feeling fresh!</p>"
          }
        },
        "acordion-1": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Why is CertiPUR-US® Certification important for foam beds?",
            "text": "<p>CertiPUR-US® certified foam ensures that the foam is free from harmful chemicals and substances. Specifically, it means the foam is made without:</p><ul><li>Ozone depleters</li><li>PBDEs (Polybrominated diphenyl ethers) and certain Tris flame retardants (TCEP, TDBPP, TDCPP, TEPA)</li><li>Mercury, lead, and other heavy metals</li><li>Formaldehyde</li><li>Phthalates</li></ul><p>Additionally, CertiPUR-US® foam undergoes rigorous testing to ensure its performance, durability, emissions, and content, with analysis conducted by independent accredited laboratories. This certification helps guarantee a safer and more environmentally friendly foam product.</p>"
          }
        },
        "acordion-2": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What does OEKO-TEX Standard 100 mean?",
            "text": "<p>OEKO-TEX Standard 100 is a certification that ensures our boucle covers and foam mattresses are free from harmful substances and chemicals, making them safe for both pets and humans.<br/><br/>This certification guarantees that the fabric meets strict safety and environmental criteria, reflecting our commitment to quality and sustainability. By choosing OEKO-TEX certified covers, you can trust that you are providing a safe, durable, and eco-friendly option for your furry friends.</p>"
          }
        },
        "d0defd0d-94c3-403c-bd36-dc2f140a104f": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Do I need to assemble the bed?",
            "text": "<p>No assembly is required. Once you unbox your dog's new bed, it will begin to expand. Your dog can use it immediately, but it may take a few hours, and up to 24 hours for the mattress to completely expand.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_wBnGmM": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Warranty and Returns",
            "text": "<h5>Returns and Exchanges</h5><p><strong>For Unopened & Unused Items Only</strong><br/>Unopened and unused beds can be returned within 7 days of receipt for a full refund or exchange. Please ensure you have not cut the vacuum seal. To check the size, carefully open the box and unroll the vacuum-sealed item without breaking the seal. If it’s not the right fit, re-roll the item, place it back in the box, and return it.</p><p>You are responsible for the cost and arrangement of return shipping.<br/><br/>Please be aware that opened beds (i.e., those with a cut vacuum seal) cannot be returned or exchanged due to shipping handling being too difficult with the bulky size and hygiene concerns.<br/></p><h5>Warranty</h5><p>We offer a 12-month warranty covering manufacturing defects, including faulty workmanship or materials. This warranty does not cover normal wear and tear or damages caused by dog use, such as excessive scratching, biting, accidents, chewing, or other use.</p><p>For warranty issues, please contact us within 48 hours of opening the bed at <a>hello@koozipets.com.au</a>, including images of the defective or damaged item. Failure to provide this information within the specified timeframe may void your exchange or refund.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_wDXPVa": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Is the Flat Dog Bed suitable for all dog breeds?",
            "text": "<p>The Flat Dog Bed is designed to accommodate most dog breeds, from extra small to larger medium breeds. With its softer memory foam and low-profile design, it provides a cushioned yet supportive feel, making it ideal for dogs that prefer a softer bed. For the best fit, we recommend reviewing our size guide and considering your dog's individual preferences.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
